          "id": "9b7fdda415a53e264b2e97c89594f26f16051b24",
          "message": "ci: enable gotestsum test rerun to absorb flaky failures\n\nOpt into the rerun-fails support in gofiber/.github's gotestsum action: move the package pattern to packages and set rerun-fails: 2, so an isolated flaky test (timing, runner speed) is retried instead of failing the whole run. A consistently failing test still fails.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
